      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "Fortunately, the boy’s nurse gave him proper temporary treatments according to his complex symptoms. She mildly squeezed the poisonous liquid out of his throat and put bandages firmly in place to apply pressure to the ankle wound to stop bleeding. As for the burn, she used scissors to remove his sleeve, poured a basin of cold water over the burn to cool it and put her hands on a damp blouse to cover his swollen tissue tightly.",
        "zh": "幸运的是，故事中的护士根据复杂症状给他做了临时处理。她轻轻地把有毒液体从他的喉部挤了出来，并将绷带牢牢固定好，给脚踝伤口加压，以止住流血。至于烧伤，她用剪刀剪去他的袖子，把一盆冷水倒在烧伤处使其降温，然后找到一件潮湿的女式衬衫，紧紧裹住他肿胀的组织。",
